# GitLab CI's bun install cache (BUN_INSTALL_CACHE_DIR in .gitlab-ci.yml). It
# must sit inside the project to be cached, and biome's vcs.useIgnoreFile reads
# this file — without the entry `bun run lint` checks every cached package.
.bun-cache/

